de><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Wildshape_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wildshape (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">Wildshape</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Stunned\"> Condition: Stunned </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\">Stunned</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected creatures cannot move or take <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Actions</a>, <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reactions</a>.</li>\n<li>Affected creatures automatically fail <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Strength and Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li>\n<li>Removed by <a href=\"/wiki/Freedom_of_Movement\" title=\"Freedom of Movement\">Freedom of Movement</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Restoration\" title=\"Greater Restoration\">Greater Restoration</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Unshackling_Strike\" title=\"Unshackling Strike\">Unshackling Strike</a>.</li>\n<li>Attack Rolls against affected creatures have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>.</li>\n<li>Breaks <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> of target when applied</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flail_of_the_Vortex\" title=\"Flail of the Vortex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flail_of_the_Vortex\" title=\"Flail of the Vortex\">Flail of the Vortex</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Air Myrmidon\">Air Myrmidon</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This weapon action has no recharge time or other limitations and is strictly better than the myrmidon's standard attack.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit repor